is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a O71 (Other obstetric trauma)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a O72 (Postpartum hemorrhage)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a O73 (Retained placenta and membranes, without hemorrhage)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a O74 (Complications of anesthesia during labor and delivery)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a O75 (Oth complications of labor and delivery, NEC)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a O76 (Abnlt in fetal heart rate and rhythm comp labor and delivery)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http:/