ncept  is-a O87 (Venous complications and hemorrhoids in the puerperium)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a O88 (Obstetric embolism)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a O89 (Complications of anesthesia during the puerperium)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a O90 (Complications of the puerperium, not elsewhere classified)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a O91 (Infect of breast assoc w pregnancy, the puerp and lactation)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a O92 (Oth disord of brst/lactatn assoc w pregnancy and the puerp)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a O94 (Sequelae of comp of pregnancy, chldbrth, and the puerperium)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a O98 (Matern infec/parastc dis classd elsw but compl preg/chldbrth)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a O99 (Oth maternal diseases classd elsw but compl preg/chldbrth)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a O9A (Maternl malig or injury compl preg/childbrth)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a Z33 (Pregnant state)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a Z34 (Encounter for supervision of normal pregnancy)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a Z36 (Encounter for antenatal screening of mother)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a Z39 (Encounter for maternal postpartum care and examination)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a M05 (Rheumatoid arthritis with rheumatoid factor)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a M06 (Other rheumatoid arthritis)</li><li>Include codes from<a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-icd10CM.html"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10-cm</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a M80 (Osteoporosis with current pathological fracture)</li></ul></div>
